\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Discussion}
\title{A cyclic sign and the weight used to average it}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{The horizontal loop of \ref{fdip-00UA} is the
product of two signs. Changing either sign negates
that product. The same link also occurs in adjacent
plaquettes, whose weights may enter the connection
sum. Which simultaneous link changes preserve every
plaquette while changing this cyclic product, and
does the matter determinant preserve them as well?}
